    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n27695" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mălĕdĭcax</span></b>  (or
		separately, <b><span class="alpheios-lex-la" lang="lat">mălĕ
			dĭ-cax</span></b> ), ācis, adj.
		male-dicax, <div class="alpheios-lex-lex_sense alpheios-lex-lex_sense1"><b>I.</b><i>foul-mouthed, abusive, slanderous, reviling</i>
